<task id="EnablingASecureHubConnectionBACnetS-00FDF71D" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic task/task "><title class="- topic/title ">Enabling a secure hub connection</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">The final step when setting up a secure hub is to enable
a secure connection.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">hub connection<indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">enabling</indexterm></indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody "><prereq class="- topic/section task/prereq ">You set up the credentials for <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">ScHubPort</uicontrol> and under <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">WebService</uicontrol>, you configured the
server certificate for connections to be accepted.</prereq><steps class="- topic/ol task/steps "><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">To enable the hub connection, navigate to the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">ScHubPort</uicontrol> node in the Nav tree.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Right-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">ScHubPort</uicontrol> and select <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Actions</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Enable</uicontrol></menucascade>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult "><p class="- topic/p ">The driver enables
the connection.</p></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">To confirm that the state of the connection, expand <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Link</uicontrol> and double-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Hub Connector</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Hub Connector</uicontrol> <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">State</parmname> displays that the hub is connected or provides an error message
if the connection was unsuccessful.</stepresult></step></steps></taskbody></task>